>>
Rule 1 (true_classes must be a rank-2 int64 tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (true_classes must have positive dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (true_classes second dimension equals num_true)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) = v_2
>>
Rule 4 (num_true, num_sampled, and range_max must be at least 1)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= v_1 ≥ 1 ∧ v_2 ≥ 1 ∧ v_3 ≥ 1
>>
Rule 5 (when unique is true, num_sampled cannot exceed range_max)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_1 then v_2 ≤ v_3
>>
Rule 6 (true_classes IDs must lie in [0, range_max))
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= min(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_1) < v_2
